  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "COLOR\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 13, CC 49 to 64\n   1 Black and white to full color\n   2 Color tint\n   3 Filter color\n   4 Number of main colors\n   5 One color that pops\n   6 Warm to cool\n   7 Color change in the scene\n   8 How true skin looks\n   9 A color for each character\n  10 Color across the whole film\n  11 A color for each place or time\n  12 A color that warns\n  13 Colors that clash on purpose\n  14 A color saved for big moments\n  15 Two colors of light on one face\n  16 Dressed in the colors of the room\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 13, CC 65 to 80\n   1 suite: Color lens\n   2 suite: The whole look\n   3 suite: Teal and orange\n   4 suite: Faded memory\n   5 suite: Black and white with one color\n   6 suite: Bleak gray\n   7 suite: Color-coded worlds\n   8 suite: Red means danger\n   9 suite: A fight under neon\n  10 suite: The gold moments\n  11 pair: When the color filter gets strong, the number of main colors drops\n  12 pair: When anger rises, the color runs warm\n  13 pair: When fear rises, the color drains\n  14 pair: When one color pops, the audience's eye locks on it\n  15 pair: When the filter turns red, the danger feels close\n  16 pair: When skin color looks far from real, the audience feels something is wrong\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 13, CC 81 to 96\n   1 pair: When one person's color rubs off on a friend, the warmth grows\n   2 pair: When two people's colors fight, their egos clash\n   3 pair: When the color travels far, the hero's change shows\n   4 pair: When colors leak between worlds, the storylines cross\n   5 pair: When the warning color shows up, dread rises\n   6 pair: When one color keeps popping, it becomes a warning\n   7 pair: When the colors clash harder, the tension climbs\n   8 pair: When one piece clashes, the whole frame starts to clash\n   9 pair: When the saved color comes back, the old feeling comes with it\n  10 pair: When a color is saved for big moments, it pops when it comes\n  11 pair: When the two colors mean a torn mind, the colors start to go wrong\n  12 pair: When they melt into the room, loneliness grows\n  13 pair: When they dress apart from the crowd, they stop melting into the room\n  14 pairs: Color follows anger, fear and joy\n  15 pairs: One red thing\n  16 pairs: Red means run\nCV-CC 4: MIDI channel 13, CC 97 to 98\n   1 pairs: Worlds collide\n   2 pairs: Colors that speak"
   },
